keyTakeaways:['Maha Shivaratri 2026 is on 15 February.','The festival is observed on Krishna Chaturdashi of Phalguna in many calendars.','Night vigil and fasting are central practices.','Om Namah Shivaya is commonly repeated through the night.','There is no single universal origin story for Shivaratri.'],
