keyTakeaways:['Ugadi and Gudi Padwa 2026 are on 19 March.','Ugadi is especially important in Karnataka, Andhra Pradesh and Telangana.','Gudi Padwa is a major Maharashtrian New Year festival.','Ugadi pachadi uses several tastes to represent the mixed nature of life.','Panchanga shravana introduces the year through the traditional calendar.'],
